/// These modules hold no code — they exist so that `cargo doc` has somewhere to put the
/// prose that does not belong on any one type.
///
/// - [`server_guide`](docs::server_guide) — providing the interface.
/// - [`client_guide`](docs::client_guide) — consuming the interface.
